\title{Cucumber Usage Reporter}
\description{
Prints how each step definition was used when the run ends, like Cucumber's
\code{usage} formatter: its expression, the mean duration of its steps and where
it's defined, then the steps it matched, the slowest first. A step definition
no step matched is \code{UNUSED}. Use it to find slow steps and step definitions
to remove. To also see the progress of the run, combine it with another
reporter in a \link{CucumberMultiReporter}.

